{
  "cells": [
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "# 🚀 Welcome to AnyINB — The Universal Polyglot Notebook\n\nAnyINB lets you run **Python, JavaScript, MongoDB, C++, Java, Rust, Go, SQL, Bash/WSL, and REST APIs** in the exact same notebook file!\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "## 🐍 1. Python with Inline Seaborn & Matplotlib\nRun the cell below to see native inline plotting with persistent REPL variables:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "value": "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\nimport seaborn as sns\n\n# Generate sample data\nnp.random.seed(42)\ndays = np.arange(1, 51)\nrevenue = 200 + (days * 2.5) + np.random.normal(0, 15, size=50)\ndf = pd.DataFrame({'Day': days, 'Revenue': revenue})\n\n# Plot with Seaborn\nsns.set_theme(style=\"whitegrid\")\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 4))\nsns.lineplot(data=df, x='Day', y='Revenue', color='royalblue', linewidth=2.5, ax=ax)\nax.set_title(\"Revenue Growth Over Time\", fontsize=14, fontweight='bold')\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.show()"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "---\n## 🍃 2. MongoDB Shell Commands\nRun Mongo commands directly in the notebook (works with live MongoDB or built-in Sandbox):"
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "mongodb",
      "value": "use ecommerce\nshow collections\ndb.users.find()"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "---\n## 🌉 3. Polyglot Data Piping\nThe data queried from MongoDB above is automatically available in Python as `IN`:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "value": "# 'IN' was automatically injected from the MongoDB cell above!\nprint(f\"Received {len(IN)} documents from MongoDB into Python:\")\nprint(IN.head() if hasattr(IN, 'head') else IN)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "---\n## ☕ 4. Smart Language Auto-Detection (Java / C++ / Rust)\nPaste code from any language without worrying about dropdowns:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "java",
      "value": "public class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        System.out.println(\"Hello from Java inside AnyINB! ☕\");\n    }\n}"
    },
    {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "---\n## 🌐 5. Instant Live Mock API Server\nDefine a local endpoint directly in a cell with `@endpoint`:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "value": "// @endpoint GET /api/products\n[\n  { \"id\": 101, \"title\": \"AnyINB Pro License\", \"price\": 0 },\n  { \"id\": 102, \"title\": \"VS Code Supercharger\", \"price\": 0 }\n]"
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
